洞，统称 ImageTragick2，攻击者可通过上传或诱导处理恶意 SVG、PostScript 内容触发。",{"_56":169,"_163":170},"2026-11-12T18:12:09.576Z","CERT/CC 漏洞公告",true,"genwmxdkg4owofu0nouad3nds","Rails Active Storage 处理 ImageMagick 附件时存在任意文件写入和读取风险，未认证攻击者上传特制文件即可触发，无需调用变体、预览或 `analyze`。",{"_56":174,"_163":170},"GitHub 安全公告",{"_153":171,"_13":31,"_28":172,"_157":178,"_159":23,"_160":161},{"_153":164,"_13":165,"_28":166,"_157":177,"_159":168,"_160":161},{"_56":169,"_163":170},{"_56":174,"_163":170},{"_182":192,"_13":193,"_20":23,"_17":102,"_185":194},{"_182":188,"_13":189,"_20":168,"_17":102,"_185":190},{"_182":183,"_13":184,"_20":21,"_17":102,"_185":186},"factId","fgL6AYVw-4lQ","分析Rails Active Storage任意文件写入漏洞","representative",{"_153":154,"_13":155,"_28":156,"_157":187,"_159":21,"_160":161},{"_56":162,"_163":161},"fLyv0qUMYfE0","披露 ImageMagick 文件读写漏洞",{"_153":164,"_13":165,"_28":166,"_157":191,"_159":168,"_160":161},{"_56":169,"_163":170},"fovPD9RB97Zo","Active Storage 图像分析可任意读写文件",{"_153":171,"_13":31,"_28":172,"_157":195,"_159":23,"_160":161},{"_56":174,"_163":170},"participants48h","newParticipants6h","recentReports24h","observationComplete","rank",7,{"_203":204,"_205":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
